    "description": "A fragile lantern made of crushed mortar and newt essence. This clockwork pickaxe emits a steam whistle to soothe kettle spirits while magically routing block chunks directly to your paired chest instead of the backpack, dissolving standard block drops in the process. Once its tension unwinds completely, the lantern shatters permanently.",
